      <!-- ALIGNMENT vs GHYaf3-d1e642 (Oyta abbreviatio). 160 sources (originally 147; 13 sorb193
           paragraphs split this pass) -> 107 targets, all 107 targets referenced, 153 sources
           mapped, 7 dropped. Q3 (utrum creatura rationalis habens gratiam possit mereri suam
           gratiam augmentari). Much less compressed than Q4/Q5; both texts follow nearly identical
           dubium-by-dubium structure.

           SOURCE SPLITS (unusual for this project: sorb193 kept coarser paragraph breaks than
           Paris1512 in several spots, so the SOURCE was split rather than the target): d998 split
           into d998/d1020/d1060 -> 618/631/669; d1204 split into d1204/d1225/d1245 -> 698/759/783;
           d1320 split into d1320/d1400/d1460 -> 838/868/907; d1978 split into d1978/d2010/d2040 ->
           1171/1182/1202; d2164 split into d2164/d2185/d2205 -> 1283/1299/1319; d2384 split into
           d2384/d2405/d2425 -> 1455/1486/1495; d2884 split into d2884/d2915 -> 1777/1822 (its
           1829 boundary already existed at d2949). All split points are approximate sense-unit
           boundaries (Oyta paraphrases rather than cutting cleanly), not exact string matches.

           REMAINING genuine target-side folds (compression, not yet split): d343<-7 (564,575,594,
           604,613,622,633; augmentatio/motus dubium); d2190<-7 (3477,3484,3518,3527,3534,3543,
           3566); d1659<-5; d2400<-5 (3706,3740,3774,3806,3864; d3864 placement still tentative);
           d245<-4; d1690<-4; d1716<-4; d698<-3 (1098,1191,1204; distinct short sources genuinely
           folded, not a coarse-paragraph issue); d448<-3; d985<-3; d1237<-3; d1753<-3; d2034<-3;
           d2069<-3.

           REORDERING: d2272 (2o principaliter probatur...) has its content split with the target
           order SWAPPED relative to source; target d1354 covers src d2272's opening+closing,
           target d1376 covers its middle clause; both point to the same whole source paragraph
           since a clean linear split of the source isn't possible.

           DROPPED (7): d132, d185, d716-partial (embedded "5m dubium an aliquae duae caritates"
           still needs isolating from d426), d1958, d2258, d2467, d3219, d4059. Also d3168's
           extensive "duration of seculars/cursus equi" discussion may need isolating from d1939.

           Fold-by-fold review with user still pending for the remaining folds above. -->
